{"summary":"From the makers of the hit app Flow Free®, comes a fun new twist: Bridges!","description":"From the makers of the hit app Flow Free®, comes a fun and challenging new twist: Bridges!\n\nIf you like Flow Free, you'll love Flow Free: Bridges®!\n\nConnect matching colors with pipe to create a Flow®. Pair all colors and cover the entire board. Use the new Bridges to cross two pipes and solve each puzzle in Flow Free: Bridges!\n\nFree play through hundreds of levels, or race against the clock in Time Trial mode. Flow Free: Bridges gameplay ranges from simple and relaxed, to challenging and frenetic, and everywhere in between. How you play is up to you. So, give Flow Free: Bridges a try, and experience \"mind like water\"!\n\nFlow Free: Bridges features:\n\n★ Over 2,500 free puzzles\n★ Free Play and Time Trial modes\n★ Clean, colorful graphics\n★ Fun sound effects\n\nSpecial thanks to Noodlecake Studios, creators of Super Stickman Golf, for their work on Flow Free: Bridges!\n\nEnjoy.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $19.99 per item","video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9tJo3a9FHPF_j5mbM2q7JOZtlN_J3UucNWgaxSYKmYrWgrE8D0kvunPLsp9eRvpqKm7ELXuKT25IA4fLhESeXg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R-7Qrkr_q0vhaRiIS3LxjN2veLsi134qzD7PyQg11NRmModi63y5YlG8IPKP3B3xoVIsonO5JAomA98q4f89","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PwOPMVO8-LrpkpifS2AqZItYikE8zQ1e9_YoxmYknV6oinmJnXmVcrq66xd7jqVXtg8LEQTRjxkGdGDAI7sH","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7qEb0uj992Zi-6MNIVjwZ4m8QzM1UUEudznwlUpebm1jrHgiOaA4mpbmeBt0TAoeuDgIkicxlM13THU1df7YOrs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ld6hKRyktip1BCyqrAr2tJFWLD1AT20l8WUtkgF5pAxd6uxJ8hPACkKFFgAC9Tsd_wR-z7m9NcMjncGkZf6U2cQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VPiwyy6O6PhCiuODEFBx7ogxTur6on11KiNT5Yh4mPTqlrtDChcBRjQ7liagCOQNF_Savo58FohSp08HmamlOlI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oVDB1fvXWGtWDJYZQZpdmBzxN4J_AlniRZO39_KRW22CK9nfHZWkeUQzS9WzC1FPxZuWRZmlIiVwiwAq7Cf5UO